Chackalayil Ayurveda Hospital,"[""+919048622669""]",+919048622669,marmacare@gmail.com,"[""https://www.justdial.com/Pathanamthitta/Chackalayil-Ayurveda-Hospital-Maramon/9999PX468-X468-240102210148-Y1T8_BZDET"",""https://www.justdial.com/Pathanamthitta/Hospitals-in-Kidangannur/nct-10253670/page-2"",""https://www.quickerala.com/pathanamthitta/kozhencherry/chackalayil-ayurveda-hospital/431442"",""https://www.facebook.com/p/%E0%B4%AE%E0%B5%BC%E0%B4%AE%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%AE-%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%AF%E0%B5%BC-%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%8B%E0%B4%B4%E0%B4%9E%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%9A%E0%B5%87%E0%B4%B0%E0%B4%BF-Chackalayil-Ayurveda-100070167909011/"",""marmacare.com"",""https://www.facebook.com/105394130881179"",""http://www.marmacare.com/""]",marmacare.com,null,https://www.facebook.com/105394130881179,null,null,null,T.b. Junction,"Kuriannoor, Maramon",null,Kozhencherry,Pathanamthitta,689641,India,IN,hospital,private,null,"With an illustrious history in the traditional Ayurveda-Sidha-Marma field, we, Chackalayil at Kozhencherry stands tall as a torchbearer in traditional Marma treatment and Ayurveda. One of our great ancestor, Sri. Neelakandan Vaidyar was talented enough to get felicitated with the 'Panicker' title from His Highness Sri Moolam Thirunaal Ramavarma, the Maharaja of Travancore, which presents a strong testimony to our glorious past. 
Walking in the footsteps of our forefathers, we, at Chakalayil has perfected effective long term treatment methodologies through Ayurveda and Marma science for a wide variety of disorders and diseases. Ajithkumar, our present chief physician is enriched with vast medical knowledge and experience, gained through the ancient Palm leaf Manusripts; his asset and strength, which is passed to him by his previous generations. Further, backed by a team of experienced doctors and therapists, we help our patients to recover from diseases and return to their normal lives. 
Chintharmani Marma shastra 
A unique system of Marma treatment believed to have been originated in ancient Tamil Nadu, developed by the Chintarmani sages, it was the treatment methodology taught and followed in traditional martial art forms of Kerala such as the Kalaripayattu. As the warriors and soldiers of the ancient kingdoms used to frequently fight in battles, the demand for a treatment system that produced quick and at the same time efficient results was deemed paramount. Henceforth into the martial art form was inducted Chintharmani marma shastra.",null,null,"[""spineNeurosurgery"",""gynecologyAndObstetrics"",""internalMedicine""]","[""Specializes in Chintharmani Marma shastra Marma treatment"",""Offers traditional Ayurveda and Marma therapy"",""Practices Ayurveda-Sidha-Marma therapies"",""Provides Marmam therapy for chronic neck pain and back pain""]",[],"[""Specializes in Ayurveda-Sidha-Marma therapies"",""Family-owned Ayurveda hospital"",""Provides Chintharmani Marma shastra Marma treatment"",""Practices traditional Ayurveda-Sidha-Marma treatment"",""Led by Chief Physician Ajithkumar"",""Offers Marmam therapy as a primary treatment modality"",""Located in Kerala, India"",""Has historical association with Neelakandan Vaidyar who was awarded the Panicker title by the Maharaja of Travancore"",""Has website marmacare.com""]",null,1,TRUE,null,null,2020-01-03,1,1000,1000,0,9.337509155,76.7097168
