Dr. Witty Raina,"[""08296968095"",""+917303555015""]",+917303555015,null,"[""https://www.vinsfertility.com/s//gurgaon/doctor/dr-witty-raina"",""https://www.cloudninecare.com/""]",https://www.cloudninecare.com/,null,null,null,null,null,"Plot Number A2, Msj House",Mayfield Garden,Landmark: Opposite Hilton Garden Inn,Gurgaon,Gurugram,122003,India,IN,doctor,private,null,"Dr. Witty Raina is a distinguished gynecologist with a remarkable educational background and over 30 years of experience in the field. She holds an MBBS and an MD in Obstetrics & Gynaecology, establishing a solid foundation for her medical expertise. Dr. Raina is known for her outstanding work, specializing in various services including addressing gynecological problems, performing Laparoscopic Surgery in Obstetrics and Gynecology, managing pregnancies complicated by PCOD, and providing comprehensive treatment for PCOD/PCOS. Her extensive experience also encompasses handling diseases during pregnancy, managing infrequent or scanty periods, addressing hormonal issues, and offering natural cycle IVF. Dr. Raina is well-regarded for her expertise in Uterine Fibroid Treatment, Adiana System, Amniocentesis, and Cervical Cerclage. Her dedication and excellence have earned her numerous accolades, including a medal for topping the OBS and Gynae in the final MBBS exam and securing honors in the subject. She is also a member of prestigious medical organizations such as MRCOG, the Federation of Obstetric and Gynaecological Societies of India (FOGSI), the Royal College of Obstetricians & Gynaecologists in London (RCOG), Delhi Medical Association (DMA), and the Indian Medical Association (IMA). Dr. Witty Raina's commitment to her field and her patients is truly commendable, making her a trusted and celebrated figure in the world of gynecology.",null,null,"[""reproductiveEndocrinologyAndInfertility"",""gynecologyAndObstetrics""]","[""Provides treatment for uterine fibroids"",""Performs amniocentesis"",""Uses Adiana Sy