Karam Laser Clinic,"[""+918007777601"",""+917777087601""]",+918007777601,info@karamlaserclinic.com,"[""karamlaserclinic.com"",""https://www.karamlaserclinic.com/"",""https://www.facebook.com/101238357898962"",""https://www.facebook.com/KaramClinic/""]",karamlaserclinic.com,null,https://www.facebook.com/101238357898962,null,null,null,Borivali (west),"Sai Baba Nagar, Borivali (west)",Mumbai-92,Mumbai,Maharashtra,92,India,IN,clinic,private,null,"WELCOME TO KARAM LASER CLINIC

The vision of a single man reinforced by the efforts and assistance of colleagues and co-workers, materialized into the establishment of Karam Laser Clinic, a state-of- the-art clinical setup in the heart of Mumbai city. Founder Dr. Puneet Kumar Gupta, it is one of the very few super specialties providing the finest care to those suffering from a spectrum of diseases that includes Piles (Mulvyadh), Constipation and Fistula (Bhagandar) amongst others. In a quest to be at par with the global standards, the clinic is equipped with the most advanced and innovative treatments available for the management of ano-rectal disorders.  
  
Working as a team that stands by the aim of 'Curing with Care’ we believe that our values should guide us on how we harness the gifts of science. As continual breakthroughs in medical science bring hope of cure, our challenge is to make sure that science serves the cause of humanity and not vice-versa. With these ethics guiding us, we aim to provide cutting edge medical care to people from all strata of society, moreover with a gentle and humane approach.  
  
Being the premier Proctology clinic of India, we take pride in having introduced Laser surgery for Piles, Pilonidal sinus, Fissure and Fistula. Providing best of the treatment for diabetic foot & Varicose Veins with laser. In the health service sector, we ensure that breakthrough treatments and exceptional facilities are made available to our patients. Thus, within a short but dynamic span of years, karam laser Clinic has blossomed into one of the distinguished Proctology centres of the city. No longer just a team, we are now a family that includes doctors, paramedical staff and our thousands of satisfied patients.",null,null,"[""generalSurgery"",""familyMedicine""]","[""Laparoscopic and minimally invasive surgery"",""Laser surgery for piles (hemorrhoids)"",""Laser surgery for pilonidal sinus"",""Laser therapy for varicose veins"",""Laser surgery for fissure"",""Laser therapy for diabetic foot"",""Laser surgery for fistula""]","[""Laser equipment used for proctology and varicose vein treatments""]","[""Centre of excellence for laparoscopic and minimally invasive surgery"",""Awarded for Best Laparoscopic & Laser Surgeon"",""Premier proctology clinic in India"",""Karam Laser Clinic has an online presence at karamlaserclinic.com"",""Dr. Puneet Kumar Gupta is a laser and laparoscopic surgeon"",""Led by Dr. Puneet Kumar Gupta (founder and Laser & Laparoscopic Surgeon)""]",null,4,TRUE,TRUE,null,null,null,null,null,null,19.21866989,72.8480072
