ry, Pulmonary Medicine, and Dental."",""Over 5,000 major surgeries performed and over 10,000 minor surgeries performed."",""Insurance partners including ICICI Lombard, Star Health, Vidal Health, HDFC ERGO, United India, National, Religare, Saveway, Universal, Apollo Munich, Raksha, Cholam, and others."",""100+ medical staff."",""Originated as The Life Clinic in July 2009 and upgraded to Life Institute of Gastroenterology and Gynaecology (LIGG) in May 2015."",""40-bed tertiary care hospital."",""The Life Seva Trust programs: TLSS (The Life Seva Scheme) for free surgeries, TLCSP (Free Cancer Screening Programme), TLHBDV (Free Hepatitis B detection and vaccination camp), TLFFS (Free Food Scheme), and TLFCS (Free Chemotherapy Scheme)."",""Emergency care provided 24/7."",""Over 17,542 patients served."",""Provides inpatient and outpatient care."",""Affiliated to The Life Seva Trust, a registered public charitable trust.""]",null,5,TRUE,TRUE,null,null,null,null,null,null,20.45582962,85.91788483
