Tobacco Cessation Centre,"[""+919051130230"",""+919475556368""]",+919051130230,info@ksdjaindentalcollege.edu.in,"[""https://www.justdial.com/Berhampore-West-Bengal/Tobacco-Cessation-Centre/9999P3482-3482-250206111835-C7Y6_BZDET"",""https://ksdjaindentalcollege.edu.in/about-us/infrastructure/tobacco-cessation-centre/""]",ksdjaindentalcollege.edu.in,null,https://www.facebook.com/115057138260205,null,null,null,"6, Ram Gopal Ghosh Road",Cossipore,null,Kolkata,West Bengal,700002,India,IN,clinic,null,null,"A Tobacco Cessation Centre set up in a Dental College is of great help in the primary prevention of oral cancer and can bring a drastic increase in quit rates. Our College is equipped with state-of-the-art Tobacco cessation clinic. Here, the trained students and staff spread awareness to the patients through verbal communication, pamphlet distribution and with the help of audio-visual aids. Dependency assessment is done through proper history taking and by the use of smoke analyser. Habit intervention is carried out step by step with distraction protocol and Nicotine replacement therapy. Further, the College has collaboration with habit counselling and rehabilitation centres.",null,null,"[""addictionMedicinePM"",""addictionMedicinePMR"",""dentistry"",""familyMedicine""]","[""Dependency assessment uses history taking."",""Nicotine replacement therapy is used as part of habit intervention."",""Habit intervention uses a distraction protocol.""]","[""Smoke analyser is used for dependency assessment.""]","[""Has website http://www.tccmsdmch.com/"",""Collaborates with habit counselling and rehabilitation centres."",""Operates a state-of-the-art tobacco cessation clinic within KSD Jain Dental College."",""Conducts tobacco cessation awareness programs using verbal communication, pamphlets, and audio-visual aids.""]",null,3,TRUE,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,24.08827019,88.25883484
